cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this book, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Ecological Analyses in Julia"
abstract: >-
  An open, bilingual (Brazilian Portuguese and English) book on ecological
  data analysis in Julia: language basics, data wrangling, visualization,
  exploratory data analysis, linear models and GLMs, writing functions, and
  resampling and simulation. The Portuguese edition is titled
  "Análises Ecológicas em Julia". Text licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; code
  licensed MIT.
authors:
